 fulfill the one or more virtual machine requests by enabling the user to utilize available variable on-demand capacity if available variable on-demand capacity is available. 



       7. The system of  claim 6 , wherein the processor is further configured to execute the computer-executable instructions to at least enable the user to dynamically adjust the bid price for the excess capacity in order to continue fulfilling the one or more virtual machine requests using the excess capacity. 


       8. The system of  claim 6 , wherein the processor is further configured to execute the computer-executable instructions to at least enable the user to submit a plurality of bids for excess capacity, each bid having a bid price based on a combination of levels of capacity for multiple categories of capacity. 


       9. The system of  claim 6 , wherein the reservation request further specifies a type of resource capacity to be used in fulfilling a virtual machine request of the one or more virtual machine requests, and wherein the processor is further configured to execute the computer-executable instructions to at least:
