       13. The computer program product of  claim 11 , wherein the one or more selected characteristics of the first tuple are generated within the operator graph. 


       14. The computer program product of  claim 11 , wherein the one or more operations includes dynamic connections. 


       15. The computer program product of  claim 11 , wherein the instructions are further executable by the computer processor to cause the computer to:
