       3. The method of  claim 2  wherein receiving the first communication from the first wireless device includes receiving the first communication at the trusted system from the first wireless device over a wired connection between the first wireless device and the trusted system. 


       4. The method of  claim 2  wherein receiving the first communication from the first wireless device includes receiving the first communication at the trusted system from the first wireless device over a wireless connection between the first wireless device and the trusted system. 


