       40. The method of  claim 39 , wherein the each storage device is geographically separate from the all other storage devices. 


       41. The method of  claim 39 , wherein each file slice of the two or more file slices is of an equal size. 


       42. The method of  claim 39 , wherein the file is sliced into a plurality of file slices, with a number of file slices in the plurality of file slices being greater than a number of storage devices in the two or more storage devices, and wherein a storage device of the two or more storage devices stores two or more non-contiguous file slices. 


