 transmitting, by the information processing apparatus to another image forming apparatus, of the print data, only subsequent pages that follow the number of print pages. 



       13. A non-transitory computer-readable medium having computer-readable program codes embodied in the medium for transmitting print data to an image forming apparatus connected via a network, the program codes when executed causing an information processing apparatus to execute the steps of:
