     14. The article of manufacture of  claim 9 , wherein the machine readable instructions, that when executed by a machine, cause the machine to contend for packet transmission comprises machine readable instructions, that when executed, cause the machine to:
 A) select a most significant digit of the binary number; 
 B) determine whether the selected digit of the binary number is zero or non-zero; 
 C) transmit a bit, during one slot interval, if the selected digit of the binary 
 number is non-zero; 
