       said exposed end shaped, generally, as a cylinder with two opposing flat sides;  
       a knob comprising:  
       a hub having an elongated, generally cylindrical body with a diameter that is generally the same size as said valve cylindrical portion diameter;  
       said hub body having a first end, a second end, and an axial cavity;  
